{'symbol': 'FTNT', 'date': '2022-08-31 09:00:00', 'title': 'MEDIA ADVISORY: FORTINET CHAMPIONSHIP SECURITY SUMMIT AND TECH EXPO BRINGS TOGETHER LEADING CYBERSECURITY TECHNOLOGY EXPERTS', 'text': "SUNNYVALE, CALIF., AUG. 31, 2022 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- JOHN MADDISON, CMO AND EVP OF PRODUCT AT FORTINET “THE SECOND ANNUAL FORTINET CHAMPIONSHIP SECURITY SUMMIT ADVANCES OUR MISSION TO SECURE PEOPLE, DEVICES, AND DATA EVERYWHERE AS WE BRING TOGETHER GLOBAL INDUSTRY LEADERS TO DISCUSS INNOVATIVE IDEAS AND SOLUTIONS FOR THE EVOLVING CYBERSECURITY LANDSCAPE. BUILDING ON THE SUCCESS OF LAST YEAR'S EVENT, THE SUMMIT WILL FOCUS ON A RANGE OF TOPICS – FROM MANAGING CYBER RISK OR IMPLEMENTING ZERO TRUST, TO CLOSING THE CYBER SKILLS GAP – TO FURTHER HELP ORGANIZATIONS PROTECT THEMSELVES FROM CYBER THREATS.”"}